3ba9e72633d5099eb5a59fae1f554c994d4bc02cc3b9436048f894e796fc5760{"version":1,"source":{"accession":"0001193125-26-157849","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-16","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001810997","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1810997/000119312526157849/d36361d20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/d9f401197cd9ecd074228e2a2155f59a7654ee7b13fa0e4eb03d07f5d1c9b224.bin","sha256":"d9f401197cd9ecd074228e2a2155f59a7654ee7b13fa0e4eb03d07f5d1c9b224"},"layers":{"businessProfile":{"status":"evidence_available","evidence":[{"id":"5f940b82c8b0f375047628d948e101ae2352349ca89a5d53cbd0c2a0bd8d13b9","quote":"The Group began its operations in 2015 through Chengxing Zhidong, a PRC limited liability company. The Group undertook a reorganization, or the Reorganization, to facilitate its initial public offering in the United States. As part of the Reorganization, the Group incorporated XPeng Inc., an exempted company incorporated under the laws of Cayman Islands, in December 2018. Subsequently, XPeng Inc. established XPeng Limited, a limited liability company established in the British Virgin Islands. XPeng Limited then established XPeng (Hong Kong) Limited, a Hong Kong limited liability company, as its wholly-owned subsidiary. XPeng (Hong Kong) Limited then established Xiaopeng Motors as a wholly foreign-owned enterprise in the PRC.","context":"A. History and Development of the Company","section":"INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":1117,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001193125-26-157849","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-16","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001810997","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1810997/000119312526157849/d36361d20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/d9f401197cd9ecd074228e2a2155f59a7654ee7b13fa0e4eb03d07f5d1c9b224.bin","sha256":"d9f401197cd9ecd074228e2a2155f59a7654ee7b13fa0e4eb03d07f5d1c9b224"}},{"id":"b79f734c60b10aa45eec67576706440dd5af3a8e88849b2d240134ee278e42a7","quote":"As a transitional arrangement of the Reorganization, Xiaopeng Motors entered into a series of contractual agreements with Chengxing Zhidong and its shareholders in September 2019, pursuant to which Xiaopeng Motors exercised effective control over the operations of Chengxing Zhidong. In connection with the Reorganization, substantially all of the former shareholders of Chengxing Zhidong have exited from Chengxing Zhidong and obtained, by themselves or through their respective affiliates, shares of XPeng Inc. based on their respective shareholding in Chengxing Zhidong prior to the Reorganization. In May 2020, Xiaopeng Motors completed its purchase of 100% equity interest in Chengxing Zhidong. Consequently, Chengxing Zhidong became an indirect wholly-owned subsidiary of XPeng Inc.","context":"Table of Contents","section":"INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":1120,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001193125-26-157849","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-16","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001810997","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1810997/000119312526157849/d36361d20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/d9f401197cd9ecd074228e2a2155f59a7654ee7b13fa0e4eb03d07f5d1c9b224.bin","sha256":"d9f401197cd9ecd074228e2a2155f59a7654ee7b13fa0e4eb03d07f5d1c9b224"}},{"id":"926bffd55e49706aa5557b497cc004bdcc97b379541ea679295f8c152b4421c7","quote":"In August 2020, we listed our ADSs on the NYSE under the symbol “XPEV.” In July 2021, we listed our Class A ordinary shares on the Hong Kong Stock Exchange under the stock code “9868.”","context":"As a transitional arrangement of the Reorganization, Xiaopeng Motors entered into a series of contractual agreements with Chengxing Zhidong and its shareholders in September 2019, pursuant to which Xiaopeng Motors exercised effective control over the operations of Chengxing Zhidong. In connection with the Reorganization, substantially all of the former shareholders of Chengxing Zhidong have exited from Chengxing Zhidong and obtained, by themselves or through their respective affiliates, shares of XPeng Inc. based on their respective shareholding in Chengxing Zhidong prior to the Reorganization. In May 2020, Xiaopeng Motors completed its purchase of 100% equity interest in Chengxing Zhidong. Consequently, Chengxing Zhidong became an indirect wholly-owned subsidiary of XPeng Inc.","section":"INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":1121,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001193125-26-157849","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-16","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001810997","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1810997/000119312526157849/d36361d20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/d9f401197cd9ecd074228e2a2155f59a7654ee7b13fa0e4eb03d07f5d1c9b224.bin","sha256":"d9f401197cd9ecd074228e2a2155f59a7654ee7b13fa0e4eb03d07f5d1c9b224"}},{"id":"c17ccaf85e1690ab3b32e341fb2dff9a38c92ea22f563015de6bc91514c7b7cb","quote":"In July 2023, we and the Volkswagen Group entered into the VW Technical Framework Agreement on strategic technical collaboration and the VW Share Purchase Agreement for strategic minority investment by the Volkswagen Group in us.","context":"In August 2020, we listed our ADSs on the NYSE under the symbol “XPEV.” In July 2021, we listed our Class A ordinary shares on the Hong Kong Stock Exchange under the stock code “9868.”","section":"INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":1122,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001193125-26-157849","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-16","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001810997","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1810997/000119312526157849/d36361d20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/d9f401197cd9ecd074228e2a2155f59a7654ee7b13fa0e4eb03d07f5d1c9b224.bin","sha256":"d9f40119